{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-fetch#card-zh","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-fetch","commit":"1538af0ab9e60b8b2fe831941f37dca075833e29","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-wsl-fetch 是面向 WSL 环境的 DSH 插件，接入 web_fetch 提供器。它在 HTTP(S)_PROXY 可用时通过 undici ProxyAgent 转发官方网页抓取，并在默认提供器未替换时选用 wsl-proxy。功能包括限制目标 URL、处理同站重定向、重试暂时性网络错误，以及限制响应大小并识别文本或 HTML。适合 Windows 与 WSL 下需要让 DSH 网页抓取经过代理的用户；使用前需设置 HTTP_PROXY 或 HTTPS_PROXY 并重启 DSH。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:6-36","lib/fetch.js:234-347"]}
{"unit_id":"173787247__dsh-wsl-fetch#card-en","repo":"173787247/dsh-wsl-fetch","commit":"1538af0ab9e60b8b2fe831941f37dca075833e29","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-wsl-fetch routes DSH web_fetch through a Windows HTTP proxy in WSL. With HTTP(S)_PROXY set, its undici ProxyAgent provider fetches pages, validates URLs, follows same-site redirects, retries transient failures, and limits response size. Configure the proxy and restart DSH to use it.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:6-36","lib/fetch.js:234-347"]}
